@startuml current-layout
title Hiện trạng — coupling và lệch SRS/ERD
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220

note as N1
  Kết luận: tách deploy frontend/backend là đúng.
  Không bị dính chặt theo kiểu monolith UI+API.
  Vấn đề là **nội bộ từng app** và **hợp đồng dùng chung chưa sống**.
end note

package "Repo (monorepo lỏng)" {
  [SRS + ERD] as Docs
  [shared\n@task-manager/shared] as Shared
  package "frontend (Vite + 1 file JS)" {
    [src/main.js God object] as FEGod
    [src/styles.css] as FECss
  }
  package "backend (NestJS)" {
    [AppModule] as App
    [modules/* 18 feature] as Mods
    [database/entities] as Ents
    [common/*.local.ts] as LocalConst
  }
}

Docs ..> Ents : ERD 90 entity\ncode mới cover một phần
Shared -[#red,dashed]-> FEGod : không import
Shared -[#red,dashed]-> Mods : không import
LocalConst -[#red]-> Shared : copy thủ công\nerror-codes / permission-keys
FEGod --> Mods : fetch URL cứng\nstate + view + API trộn
App --> Mods
Mods --> Ents

note bottom of FEGod
  SRS §3.4.2 cần 6 nhóm màn hình.
  Hiện: 1 global state, innerHTML, prompt/alert,
  không router, không client API, không type.
end note

note bottom of Mods
  Tách module Nest khá tốt (auth, org, project, issue…).
  IssueModule ôm search + attachment + security.
  SavedFilter nằm dưới issue/.
  Thiếu Configuration Schemes (workflow_scheme,
  priority/field/screen schemes) so với ERD.
end note
@enduml

@startuml target-system
title Mục tiêu hệ thống — 3 process + hợp đồng dùng chung (SRS §2.1, §7.1)
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Org / Project member" as User
actor Worker as W

package "shared (npm workspace)" {
  [enums] as Enums
  [ERROR_CODES] as Err
  [PERMISSION_KEYS] as Perm
  [command / query DTO types] as Dto
}

rectangle "Frontend SPA" as FE {
  [app shell + router] as Shell
  [feature screens] as Screens
  [api client] as ApiClient
}

rectangle "API (NestJS)" as API {
  [HTTP controllers] as Http
  [application services] as AppSvc
  [domain rules / FSM] as Domain
}

rectangle "Worker" as WK {
  [outbox publisher] as Outbox
  [notification delivery] as Notif
  [background jobs] as Jobs
}

database PostgreSQL
database Redis
cloud "Object storage" as Store

User --> Shell
Shell --> Screens
Screens --> ApiClient
ApiClient --> Http : REST, error-code ổn định
Http --> AppSvc
AppSvc --> Domain
AppSvc --> PostgreSQL
AppSvc --> Redis : session/idempotency/cache
AppSvc --> Store : attachment
AppSvc --> Outbox : cùng transaction (NFR-REL-01)
W --> WK
WK --> PostgreSQL
WK --> Redis

Enums <.. FE
Enums <.. API
Err <.. FE
Err <.. API
Perm <.. FE
Perm <.. API
Dto <.. FE
Dto <.. API

note right of WK
  Worker không impersonate user (SRS actor Worker).
  Recheck permission/filter lúc chạy job/webhook.
end note
@enduml

@startuml bounded-contexts
title Bounded context = gói ERD + catalog SRS (không để UI quyết định module)
top to bottom direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "API Core (58 entity)" {
  package "Identity & Access" as C1 {
    [Auth / Session] as Auth
    [Organization / Member / RBAC] as Org
    [Department / Group] as People
  }
  package "Workspace" as C2 {
    [Project / Role / Permission scheme] as Proj
    [Board / Column / Rank] as Board
    [Sprint / Sprint history] as Sprint
    [Component / Version] as CatalogP
  }
  package "Workflow FSM" as C3 {
    [Workflow / State / Transition / Guard] as Wf
    [Workflow scheme + transition permission] as WfScheme
  }
  package "Issue & Collaboration" as C4 {
    [Issue aggregate] as Issue
    [Comment / Attachment / Work log] as Collab
    [Label / Watcher / Link] as Rel
    [Custom field values] as CfVal
  }
  package "Audit & Async" as C5 {
    [Activity + state history] as Audit
    [Outbox] as Ox
    [Notification + preference + delivery] as Notify
    [Background jobs] as Job
  }
}

package "Phase 2–3 (32 entity) — module riêng, không nhét vào Issue" {
  [Configuration schemes\npriority / type / field / screen] as Conf
  [Issue security scheme] as Sec
  [Saved filter / share / subscription / search] as Search
  [Hierarchy / planning] as Plan
  [Dashboard / widget] as Dash
  [Automation rule / execution] as Auto
  [API token / Webhook] as Integ
}

Org --> Proj
Proj --> Board
Proj --> Sprint
Wf --> WfScheme
WfScheme --> Issue
Issue --> Collab
Issue --> Rel
Issue --> CfVal
Issue --> Audit
Issue --> Ox
Ox --> Notify
Ox --> Auto
Ox --> Integ
Search --> Issue : query permission-aware
Conf --> Issue : field/screen/priority
Sec --> Issue : read filter
Dash --> Search

note as DEP
  Quy tắc phụ thuộc:
  1. Context ngoài không import entity nội bộ của Issue trừ qua IssueService.
  2. Frontend không import TypeORM entity — chỉ DTO shared.
  3. Phase 2–3 được phép thiếu UI, không được phép kéo schema vào IssueModule.
  4. Authorization luôn server-side (NFR-SEC-01). UI chỉ ẩn nút.
end note
@enduml

