  }
  folder "frontend/" as fe {
    folder "src/app\n(router, layout, providers)" as app
    folder "src/shared/ui" as sui
    folder "src/shared/api\n(http client, error map)" as sapi
    folder "src/features/auth"
    folder "src/features/work"
    folder "src/features/project"
    folder "src/features/board"
    folder "src/features/issue"
    folder "src/features/admin-org"
    folder "src/features/admin-project"
    folder "src/features/notifications"
    folder "src/features/search"
    folder "src/features/reports"
    folder "src/features/automation"
    folder "src/features/integrations"
  }
}

note bottom of fe
  Mỗi feature/:
    api.ts     — gọi endpoint, map ERROR_CODES
    types.ts   — re-export DTO shared
    pages/     — màn hình SRS §3.4.2
    components/
    hooks/ hoặc store slice
  Cấm: 1 file vừa render vừa fetch vừa giữ toàn bộ state app.
end note

note bottom of issuemod
  Tách ra khỏi IssueModule hiện tại:
    attachment → issue/collab hoặc module storage-aware
    issue-search + saved-filter → modules/search
    issue-security entities → modules/security-scheme
end note
@enduml

@startuml frontend-screens
title Frontend — map nhóm màn hình SRS §3.4.2 → feature folder
left to right direction

package "Public / Auth" {
  [Register / Login / Reset] as A1
}
package "Personal" {
  [My work / assigned] as P1
  [Notifications] as P2
  [Profile / sessions] as P3
}
package "Organization admin" {
  [Org settings / people] as O1
  [Roles / dept / group] as O2
  [Workflow + catalogs] as O3
}
package "Project" {
  [Summary / backlog] as J1
  [Board / sprint] as J2
  [Members / schemes] as J3
  [Components / versions] as J4
}
package "Issue detail" {
  [Fields / activity] as I1
  [Comment / attach / worklog] as I2
  [Transition / links] as I3
}
package "Reports / Ops" {
  [Dashboards] as R1
  [Jobs / audit / outbox] as R2
  [Tokens / webhooks] as R3
}

A1 --> P1 : sau session
P1 --> I1
J2 --> I1
P2 --> I1
J3 --> J2
O3 --> J3

note as FEAPI
  Mọi feature chỉ nói chuyện với backend qua src/shared/api.
  OrgId / projectId lấy từ workspace context, không nhét vào mỗi view.
  Validation UI không thay server (NFR-UX-01).
end note
@enduml

@startuml backend-module-slice
title Backend — slice chuẩn cho mỗi bounded context
left to right direction

package "src/modules/<context>/" {
  [context.module.ts] as M
  [context.controller.ts] as C
  [application/*.service.ts] as S
  [dto/*.ts] as D
  [policies/*.ts\n(RBAC + tenant checks)] as Pol
}

[database/entities/<context>/*.entity.ts] as E
[common/guards] as G
[modules/outbox] as Ox
[modules/permission] as Perm

C --> S
S --> Pol
S --> E
S --> Ox : command P0 ghi event cùng TX
C --> G
Pol --> Perm
D ..> shared : class-validator + shared types

note bottom
  Issue update / transition: expected version + idempotency key (SRS §7.1).
  Cross-tenant UUID: 403/404 anti-enumeration, không leak object (NFR-SEC-01).
end note
@enduml

